{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-18_6.31.10.png?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Goblin Gnome Horn&quot;</strong> is <strong>a casual 2D side-scrolling action game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players control a small goblin named &quot;Nekbi&quot; and aim to defeat the Demon King by collecting acorns through various mini-games such as &quot;chopping firewood&quot; and &quot;cleaning the toilet.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Labor&quot; - Simple mini-games such as only clicking or only moving up, down, left and right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Battle&quot; - Side-scrolling action battles against the demon king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is estimated that it will take about 2 hours to complete. It can be enjoyed casually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Labor (Mini-game)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a2.gif?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThere are a total of 6 types of labor (mini-games).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou can earn acorns depending on how well you do in the mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbIf you get an S rank in a mini-game, you'll get a lot of acorns and new mini-games will be unlocked. Aim to get an S rank.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trading (shop)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-24_4.47.39.png?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou can purchase equipment and skills with acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou'll need a lot of acorns to purchase powerful equipment, so play the mini-game multiple times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a.gif?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThe only enemy is the Demon King. He is in the next room, so you can challenge him anytime and as many times as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThe game is cleared when you defeat the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Left click to attack, right click to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou can recover stamina by consuming acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbIt's up to you whether you defeat the Demon King by working hard and using strong equipment, or by using your own strength.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675060?t=1746137001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/ff2aa5e049a7e41a64e1888ff030fe75bacd83e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746137001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/d49d9b942ba8ed19b58f78e90d178fefba80e8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746137001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/d49d9b942ba8ed19b58f78e90d178fefba80e8aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746137001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-18_6.31.10.png?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Goblin Gnome Horn&quot;</strong> is <strong>a casual 2D side-scrolling action game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players control a small goblin named &quot;Nekbi&quot; and aim to defeat the Demon King by collecting acorns through various mini-games such as &quot;chopping firewood&quot; and &quot;cleaning the toilet.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Labor&quot; - Simple mini-games such as only clicking or only moving up, down, left and right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Battle&quot; - Side-scrolling action battles against the demon king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is estimated that it will take about 2 hours to complete. It can be enjoyed casually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Labor (Mini-game)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a2.gif?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThere are a total of 6 types of labor (mini-games).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou can earn acorns depending on how well you do in the mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbIf you get an S rank in a mini-game, you'll get a lot of acorns and new mini-games will be unlocked. Aim to get an S rank.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trading (shop)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-24_4.47.39.png?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou can purchase equipment and skills with acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou'll need a lot of acorns to purchase powerful equipment, so play the mini-game multiple times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a.gif?t=1746137001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThe only enemy is the Demon King. He is in the next room, so you can challenge him anytime and as many times as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThe game is cleared when you defeat the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Left click to attack, right click to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou can recover stamina by consuming acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbIt's up to you whether you defeat the Demon King by working hard and using strong equipment, or by using your own strength.</strong></p>","developers":["kawashiri_kodama","Aida_ippo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675060/983e10367f6115ce02b794d4d51f2de723003da7/header.jpg?t=1746137001","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9\ufe0eKAWASHIRI KODAMA","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (2.5GHz) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Graphics / Apple M1 integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130358,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130358/movie480.mp4?t=1746136999","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130358/movie_max.mp4?t=1746136999"},"name":"Goblin Gnome Horn Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130358/432d4c5dae59b8493781c3c470d3088f990a69c2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746136999","webm":{"480":"http: